  "id": "755f81c5-55fd-471c-b1b8-8680653e5de6",
  "title": "White House blocks CNN from traveling aboard Air Force One amid media restrictions",
  "summary": "The White House has blocked CNN from traveling aboard Air Force One for President Donald Trump's Saturday trip to Tennessee, amid ongoing disputes over media access and First Amendment concerns. A similar incident involving a plane swap led to the evacuation of the president via a catering truck, with the plane sent back into the skies again in response to an Iranian assassination threat.",
  "facts": [
    {
      "statement": "The White House confirmed CNN’s exclusion from Air Force One when it did not list the network on guidance sent to the press corps regarding Trump’s schedule for Saturday.",
      "confidence": 0.95
    },
    {
      "statement": "The administration’s media restrictions include a ban on CNN from traveling aboard Air Force One, with the White House confirming this as part of an ongoing conflict with First Amendment implications.",
      "confidence": 0.95
    },
    {
      "statement": "CNN reported that the White House had been scheduled to fly with President Trump for a college football game, but the network was blocked from the flight in question.",
      "confidence": 0.95
    }
  ],
